1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,920
You started this, Mr. Kang.

2
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:35,580
Mmm hmmm...
Mmhmm... Mmm...

3
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,760
Why are you stopping?

4
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,650
Ah... Mr. Kang...

5
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:52,150
Ah, I really...

6
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,030
That's a shame.

7
00:01:58,490 --> 00:01:59,789
What?

8
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:08,669
I said a 10-minute break for the meeting,
but 15 minutes have already passed.

9
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:23,600
This is driving me crazy, seriously, Mr. Kang...

10
00:02:32,110 --> 00:02:36,780
Ko Taewoon / Kim Dohyun

11
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:53,210
Baek Seunghoon / Lee Kyungwon

12
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:12,150
Twisted Tie

13
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:15,450
Episode 2. Hide and Seek Under the Desk

14
00:03:16,950 --> 00:03:24,290
For this Hannam-dong VIP lounge proposal,
the overall traffic flow is too predictable.

15
00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:30,880
What the client requested
is not an open space...

16
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:36,550
that anyone can see,
but a perfectly private structure that blocks all lines of sight.

17
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:45,350
The exterior of the space may look cold and refined on the outside,
but as you go further inside...

18
00:04:22,050 --> 00:04:24,720
Mr. Kang, coffee.

19
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:03,930
Mr. Kang, this is really delicious.

20
00:05:03,930 --> 00:05:08,430
If you take care of me like this from now on,
I'll truly be loyal to you for the rest of my life.

21
00:05:09,230 --> 00:05:13,940
Forget loyalty, just eat slowly before you choke.

22
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:21,400
Um...

23
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:25,950
What is your usual type, Mr. Kang?

24
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:29,790
An ideal type question, all of a sudden?

25
00:05:31,370 --> 00:05:36,630
Well, recently we...
had this and that happen,

26
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:41,510
And since you're personally
packing lunches for me, Mr. Kang,

27
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:46,800
I feel like I don't really know much
about you in return.

28
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:52,640
Have you always liked my type?

29
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:58,440
Hmm... Well.

30
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:04,160
Originally, I liked people who are sensitive, neat freaks like me,

31
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:07,740
and quiet.

32
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:11,330
Ah... I see.

33
00:06:12,210 --> 00:06:16,040
- But that's changed a bit lately.
- What?

34
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:18,340
H... how so?

35
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:22,970
Someone who eats whatever I give them, is simple,

36
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:30,890
and even if they act like a wild beast sometimes,
they just look cute and pretty to me.

37
00:06:35,230 --> 00:06:39,860
S-still, you should have a bite too, Mr. Kang.

38
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:46,240
You gave me your portion too,
and you've only been drinking water since last night.

39
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:53,909
- I'm keeping my stomach empty for a reason.
- What?

40
00:06:55,330 --> 00:06:58,670
Still, you shouldn't be on an empty stomach.

41
00:06:58,670 --> 00:07:03,050
Just one bite. Come on, hurry, say ahh.

42
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:06,930
Such stubbornness...

43
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:04,360
Ah, Mr. Kang, are you okay?

44
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,860
Ah, my teeth bumped you.

45
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:09,030
Are you... are you bleeding?

46
00:08:09,030 --> 00:08:12,070
Ahh, I must be crazy.

47
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:21,540
Are you planning to eat me up?

48
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:27,800
No, I'm sorry.
I was confident in my kissing skills,

49
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:33,179
but this stage with a man is really my first time,
so I don't know where or how to start...

50
00:08:33,179 --> 00:08:37,600
Relax a bit, Mr. Lee.

51
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:40,730
I'm the one who should be nervous.

52
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:51,160
Don't use your teeth.
You need to take it in completely with your lips, then use your tongue.

53
00:08:52,370 --> 00:08:56,200
Just do exactly as I teach you, understand?

54
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:58,660
Yes... Mr. Kang.

55
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:04,690
Do it yourself... You know how to, right?

56
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:13,530
I'm going crazy, seriously.

57
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:23,040
Wait...

58
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:25,920
Ah... Sunwoo.

59
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:28,290
Too deep...

60
00:10:35,970 --> 00:10:37,930
Are you okay?

61
00:10:37,930 --> 00:10:41,970
I feel like I did it too... roughly.

62
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:49,190
If we do another practical tutoring session...
I'm going to die.

63
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:56,490
What... why are you looking at me like that?

64
00:10:57,870 --> 00:11:03,040
Mr. Kang, seriously,
do you know you drive people crazy?

65
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:08,080
You usually look like you wouldn't bleed
even a drop if pricked, but...

66
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:13,800
Stop talking nonsense and turn off the light. I'm tired.

67
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:37,070
Instead of tutoring... I just want to keep holding you like this.

68
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:41,620
Tomorrow, and the day after too.

69
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,080
You really...

70
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:22,320
On the existing blueprint, the service route in Zone B
and the VVIP route are adjacent,

71
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:26,790
so there's always a risk of accidental encounters during lounge operations.

72
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:34,040
It was pointed out as a security vulnerability.

73
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:41,300
Now, the traffic flow revision for Zone B...
Mr. Lee, you took charge of this, right?

74
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,560
Put it on the screen.

75
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,600
Yes, Mr. Kang.

76
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:59,150
Um, Mr. Kang, well...
your tie is a little crooked.

77
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:01,860
What are you doing right now?

78
00:13:02,950 --> 00:13:05,120
Ah, your tie was...

79
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,950
Mr. Lee.

80
00:13:08,370 --> 00:13:10,920
Can't you distinguish between professional and personal matters?

81
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:16,550
Do you think this is a place to entertain your personal jokes?

82
00:13:18,010 --> 00:13:21,130
Ah, no. I was just...

83
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:26,390
Mr. Lee, it's meeting time with the whole team gathered.

84
00:13:26,850 --> 00:13:29,560
Get a grip on yourself.

85
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:35,190
Put the proposal on the screen, step back, and do a proper briefing.

86
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,910
What is this?

87
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:56,250
Was last night... just a joke?

88
00:13:56,880 --> 00:14:04,340
Or am I just...
a convenient sex partner he can call up, is that it?

89
00:14:08,930 --> 00:14:13,440
Mr. Kang, earlier in the meeting room,
why on earth did you act like that?

90
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:17,820
Last night,
you treated me so sweetly,

91
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:23,530
Last night was last night,
and right now is working hours.

92
00:14:24,070 --> 00:14:27,740
I believe I told you to keep personal and professional matters separate.

93
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:31,330
Personal and professional matters?

94
00:14:33,330 --> 00:14:37,080
Then what exactly am I to you, Mr. Kang?

95
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:40,920
Just someone you call only at night when you need them,

96
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,420
like a casual partner?

97
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:48,260
Yes, keeping it professional? I understand perfectly.

98
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:22,340
There are a lot of eyes on us. Are you really sulking?

99
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:34,100
Mr. Kang, we just got feedback
from the client regarding Zone A.

100
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:34,980
- Yeah.
- I need a quick approval...

101
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:38,560
Hand it over. What... what's the issue?

102
00:15:39,650 --> 00:15:45,570
So there's a request to change
the marble finish here to matte...

103
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:49,700
Ah...

104
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:52,280
Mr. Kang?

105
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:55,910
Ah, keep going. To matte...

106
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:59,120
To matte...

107
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:03,300
If we change it to matte, the unit price...

108
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:19,980
- That's enough, you may leave.
- Yes, thank you.

109
00:16:27,610 --> 00:16:31,410
Lee Sunwoo, are you really crazy?

110
00:16:33,620 --> 00:16:36,580
You're really driving me... Haa...

111
00:16:43,710 --> 00:16:47,260
Where did you learn such cheeky behavior?

112
00:16:58,350 --> 00:17:03,060
M-Mr. Kang, what are you doing right now...
Mr. Kang! Ah!

113
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:07,069
Mr. Kang, the President wants you in the meeting room right away...

114
00:17:07,859 --> 00:17:09,780
Oh? Mr. Lee?

115
00:17:09,780 --> 00:17:14,240
What is it, Mr. Lee? I heard Mr. Kang called you.
Where did Mr. Kang go?

116
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:18,250
Ah, that... uh, Mr. Kang went down for a moment...

117
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:23,040
- Mr. Lee...
- Ah, no, well... an outside meeting. Yes, an outside meeting.

118
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:31,680
- Mr. Lee, are you sick? You're sweating buckets...
- Ah, no, no... Yeah...

119
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,550
Alright.

120
00:17:33,930 --> 00:17:38,140
Ah, um, M... Mr. Kang said
there was an issue at the VVIP lounge site,

121
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:41,060
so he hurriedly left for the site.

122
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:45,150
As for the meeting with the President,
I will report to him over the phone... Yeah.

123
00:17:45,150 --> 00:17:48,230
Uh... alright. You startled me.

124
00:17:48,230 --> 00:17:54,990
- Mr. Lee, you really don't look well today, so take it easy.
- Ah... yes... thank you.

125
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:08,920
I'm going crazy, seriously.

126
00:18:10,670 --> 00:18:16,140
Mr. Lee,
you are really terrible at lying.

127
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:21,850
How can a team leader who left for the site
go to the meeting room?

128
00:18:21,850 --> 00:18:26,980
Ah, that's because you
kept teasing me from down there, Mr. Kang...

129
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:32,610
Who played a joke first?
You started it, and now you're pretending to be the victim?

130
00:18:42,580 --> 00:18:45,370
I'm not done yet.

131
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:27,500
Mr. Baek,

132
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:30,040
What are you... doing right now...

133
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:35,010
I brought the additional order list you requested...

134
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,270
You...

135
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:47,600
What are you doing right now...

136
00:20:33,070 --> 00:20:39,240
Twisted Tie
